  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/02J5">Lemma <span data-tag="02J5">29.16.9</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a Jacobson scheme. Any scheme locally of finite type over $S$ is Jacobson. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
