      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is clear from Algebra, Proposition <a href="/tag/00GB" data-tag="00GB">10.35.19</a> (and Properties, Lemma <a href="/tag/01P4" data-tag="01P4">28.6.3</a> and Lemma <a href="/tag/01T2" data-tag="01T2">29.15.2</a>). 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
